{
  "_comment": "一个文件可以写多个武器。damage_panel 是武器刺击/打击/斩击修正。attack_speed_multiplier 是攻击动画倍率，会和护甲/技能等速度倍率乘算。armor_break_multiplier 是攻击造成护甲耐久消耗的倍率。real_hitbox_size_units/offset/rotation 可按武器覆盖真实武器碰撞盒。attack_moves/stance_animations 可按方向绑定单独动作。",
  "_tag_comment": "items 中的键可以写成 #namespace:tag，或在单项文件中使用 tag 字段。精确物品 ID 配置优先，tag 只作为未精确配置武器的兜底；aliases 也支持 #tag。",
  "_tag_example": {
    "items": {
      "#example_mod:longswords": {
        "damage_panel": {"thrust": 0.8, "strike": 0.4, "slash": 1.1},
        "attack_speed_multiplier": 0.9,
        "attack_moves": {
          "right": "attack_right_longsword",
          "left": "attack_left_longsword"
        }
      },
      "example_mod:special_longsword": {
        "attack_speed_multiplier": 1.05
      }
    },
    "inheritance": "defaults/equipment.json global -> #example_mod:longswords -> example_mod:special_longsword"
  },
  "_durability_comment": "weapon_toughness 是用武器格挡时消耗的耐久；minimum_durability_panel_multiplier 是武器损坏至极限时刃口面板的最低倍率；held_movement_speed_multiplier 是手持移动速度倍率。单独武器配置会覆盖 defaults/equipment.json 的 global 默认值。",
